              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Duke"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a hit! I did as other reviewers suggested and added a 1/4 c of mayo, about 1/4 c. of orange sweet pepper, couple dashes of old bay, a tsp of chopped garlic, salt &amp; pepper. I spread it in a dish and topped with cocktail sauce before serving.",
