            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MARYLEE23"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this for NYE party and it was a big hit! I made as directed except added a tsp or so of creole seasoning and instead of a ball I did a thin layer on a large platter and covered with cocktail sauce. Was sooooo good!",
            "datePublished": "2011-01-02T16:53:23.737Z"
          },
